Subject: Re: [shinyapps-users] To ShinyApps team: any plans to offer granular admin user permissions (ie on a per app basis)
Message-ID: <g06brXXdv2k.Odsb4NexCQAJ@shinyapps-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <g06brXXdv2k.S8HAp2uuCQAJ@shinyapps-users.groups.google.com>
