Error in duplicated.default(col) : duplicated() applies only to vectors

Do you know what could be causing this? I thought it might be the tooltip leveraging the function in sever.R; when I tried removing it and the key:=id mapping in the ggvis function, the output was the same, but I got a different error message: Error in if (tag$name %in% c("area", "base", "br", "col", "command", "embed",  :   argument is of length zero

Any help would be greatly appreciated!

Thanks
Simit

